  "solution": "<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">}</mo></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Các giá trị của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>m</mi></semantics></math> thoả mân <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>ℤ</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></semantics></math> là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></semantics></math>. Thay lần lưọt các giá trị này vào biểu thức <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>m</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></semantics></math> ta được <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>;</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>;</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>;</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac><mo>;</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">}</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Vì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>ℕ</mi></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math> hay <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></semantics></math>. Mà <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>ℕ</mi></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>x</mi></semantics></math> chỉ nhận các giá trị <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></semantics></math>. Từ đó, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>y</mi></semantics></math> nhận các giá trị tương ứng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.\n\t\t\tVậy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>7</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">}</mo></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Vì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>ℕ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>ℕ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></semantics></math>. Ứng với mỗi giá trị <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">}</mo></mrow></semantics></math>, ta tìm các giá trị <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>ℕ</mi></mrow></semantics></math> thoả mãn <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, ta được bảng sau:\n\t\t\t<div class=\"tex-center\"><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table class=\"tex-table\"><tbody><tr><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>x</mi></semantics></math></td><td>0</td><td>1</td><td>2</td><td>3</td></tr><tr><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>y</mi></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math></td><td>0</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\n\t\t\tTừ đó, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>;</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>;</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>;</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>;</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>;</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>;</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>;</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>;</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>;</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">}</mo></mrow></semantics></math>.</li></ol>",
